Text buttonmgr/instructions
Move buttons back and forth between the two lists by clicking "Add" and "Remove".  Buttons in the "Current Buttons" list will appear at the bottom of Picasa in the order you give them here.  Use "Move Up" and "Move Down" to arrange the order of the buttons.  (Top-to-bottom here equals left-to-right in the application)

Text buttonmgr/leftlist_text
Available Buttons:

